    <briefdescription>
<para>Representative of a block. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is a simple wrapper around an index into the reverse-post-order traversal of the blocks.</para>
<para>Unlike a block pointer, its order has meaning (location in the topological sort) and it&apos;s class is the same regardless of block type. </para>
